        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-402 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing Analytics &amp; Margin Optimization (PA-57.3).) | - CTL-402 (ROI-accuracy — links to VS-17); operational: CFO sign-off
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
