        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-402 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing Analytics &amp; Margin Optimization (PA-57.3).) | - CTL-402 (price-consistency — links to VS-08); operational: Ecom Ops Manager weekly sign-off
Owner: Ecommerce Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
